    "body": "Attendees: smaug, kagami, annevk, zcorpan, marcos, mike[tm], keith\r\n\r\nReview past action items\r\n* Olli will add a comment before TPAC to [[View Transitions] Extend render-blocking to support Document](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9332), where we will discuss this further.\r\n   * This was discussed at TPAC.\r\n   * Olli will add a comment asking for a summary of the TPAC discussion.\r\n\r\nCarryovers from last time\r\n* [Anne] [Use inside settings to fetch the descendants of module worker in the worker module script graph](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9571)\r\n   * Discussed at TPAC.\r\n   * Needs to continue to be carryover due to lack of Google presence.\r\n\r\nNew topics\r\n\r\n* [Keith] [Add autopause attribute to media elements to allow automatic pausing of media](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9793)\r\n   * Simon will add comments to this issue and the linked issue.\r\n* [Anne] [Should throw SecurityError when loading a worker with a cross-origin script](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9794)\r\n   * Needs to be carryover due to lack of Google presence.\r\n* [Marcos] [Add TextTrackCue ctor & cue + cuebackground attributes](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9771)\r\n   * Simon will take a look.",
