    "body": "> We have had some issues with people not being able to join because nobody present could approve them. And not everyone has a Google account we would be able to add to the invite. It would be great if we could find some kind of solution for that for next time.\r\n\r\nSorry about that, and thanks for persevering despite the difficulties. I guess this is the first time nobody from Google could join.\r\n\r\nI don't think a Google account is necessary and we have already invited several people with their non-Google email addresses. But I went ahead and added some folks as co-hosts (including the editors) to avoid approval issues in the future. I plan to cancel meetings when none of these folks can attend or add more co-hosts as necessary.",
